From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cryolitia PukNgae <cryolitia@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:01:44 +0800
Subject: i2c: qcom-geni: retain DMA buffers while GPI may still access them

Give each GENI I2C DMA transfer its own buffer. Wait for completion before reusing a buffer and keep mappings when DMA termination fails. Recovery can release these buffers after the DMA engine confirms shutdown.

Link: https://github.com/slwyts/Project-SunUEFI/commit/19b810da9b9078c5925edb71f6e3a56259bb2f81
Signed-off-by: Cryolitia PukNgae <cryolitia@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-qcom-geni.c | 295 +++++++++++++++++------------
 1 file changed, 178 insertions(+), 117 deletions(-)

